        "text_A7fFxQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Ameda’s <a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/products/ameda-hygienikit-breast-milk-storage-bottle-with-lock-tight-cap-4-count\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">breast milk storage bottles</span></a> provide a safe and convenient solution for storing and feeding expressed milk. Made without BPA, these bottles feature clear measurement markings for accurate portioning. Designed for compatibility with Ameda breast pumps and nipples, they allow for an easy transfer from pumping to feeding, ensuring every drop of milk is preserved.</p>",
